{"page": 1408, "total_pages": 1554, "total": 77652, "skills": [{"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1778294316091, "description": "This skill should be used when auditing game promotional materials, screenshots, CG images, copywriting, event pages, or launch plans for China mainland compliance, legality, IP risk, cultural/religious risk, sensitive-date conflict, and public-opinion risk. It uses the bundled local knowledge base first, optionally refreshes from zzanezhu's Lexiang personal knowledge base when available, cross-checks external public information, and produces a structured HTML audit report.", "description_zh": "「游戏素材预审」是一套面向游戏宣发素材的合规审核 Skill。\n\n它会优先使用本地内置知识库，对用户提供的图片、截图、文案、活动日期、投放地区等信息进行合规初筛，并在需要时结合公开信息检索，输出结构化审核结论或 HTML 审核报告。\n\n核心能力包括：\n\n中国大陆游戏宣发素材合规审核\n海外重点市场监管趋势辅助判断\n色情低俗、性感化、露肤风险判断\n知识产权与第三方 IP 风险判断\n广告法、虚假宣传、诱导点击风险判断\n未成年人保护、防沉迷、概率披露风险判断\n文化、宗教、民族、全球市场禁忌风险判断\n战争、军事、国旗、真实历史事件风险判断\n敏感日期、舆情扩散、公关预案风险判断\n输出可交付的 HTML 审核报告\n\n适合用于素材上线前的第一轮自查，帮助各位同学快速发现明显风险点，提前减少返工和审核沟通成本。\n\n需要特别说明：本技能输出内容仅作为发布前合规初筛参考，不构成最终审核结论。素材是否可上线、是否需要修改或下架，最终仍应以法务、合规、公关老师的正式判断为准。\n\n欢迎大家拍砖，有哪些风险未识别、规则不准确或建议补充的地方，欢迎企微联系 zzanezhu（朱奕坤）。", "downloads": 111, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_3d72c9b3/game-material-precheck", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7422abc7-fa86-4505-a723-0575c56e7a2d.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "游戏素材预审", "ownerName": "user_3d72c9b3", "score": 24288.840262582056, "slug": "game-material-precheck", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781617877675, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1776826302207, "description": "Use when Codex needs to download academic 